{
  "id": "hiring-we-hired",
  "title": "Role filled: we hired!",
  "description": "Closes the loop on a role post once it is filled: “We hired” and the role on the red brush stroke, beside the photo, with a handwritten note; follow it with the person’s Welcome to Massive card. Source: welcome-template (Franklin Uche, Community Lead).",
